// OSRS locs imported by tools/models/importosrsmap.py (osrslocimport.py).
//
// THREE OPS ARE COMMENTED OUT BELOW, by hand after the import, because this build has nothing
// behind them and an op with no trigger is a dead click: the chest's Deposit wants a deposit box
// (a much later feature), the crate's Search wants a searchable-crate table Zul-Andra is not in,
// and the "Inconspicuous hole" is a Construction hotspot that has no business on a village floor.
// Re-running the importer puts them back - take them out again.
// Models re-encoded by osrs2ob2.py with the loc recolours baked in.

// [osrsloc_816] is NOT repeated here: the Kraken Cove round already imported it
// (area_kraken_cove/configs/kraken_cove.loc) and a config may be declared once. The loc
// itself is still placed on this square - the pack id is shared, which is the point.
